@startuml SSD_01_Player_Move_Look
title SSD-01 플레이어 이동 및 시점 조작
actor "플레이어" as Player
participant "Game System" as System

Player -> System: inputMovement(moveVector, lookDelta)
Player -> System: inputSprint(isPressed)
Player -> System: inputJump()
System --> Player: avatarPoseUpdated(position, rotation, animationState)

alt 입력 차단 상태
  Player -> System: inputMovement(moveVector, lookDelta)
  System --> Player: ignoreGameplayInput()
end
@enduml

@startuml SSD_02_Grab_Drop_Throw
title SSD-02 물리 오브젝트 잡기/놓기/던지기
actor "플레이어" as Player
participant "Game System" as System

Player -> System: requestGrab(viewRay)
alt 잡을 수 있는 대상이 유효함
  System --> Player: objectAttachedToHoldPoint(objectId)
  Player -> System: requestDrop()
  System --> Player: objectReleased(objectId)
else 던지기 입력
  Player -> System: requestThrow(direction, force)
  System --> Player: objectThrown(objectId)
else 대상 없음 또는 거리 초과
  System --> Player: grabRejected(reason)
end
@enduml

@startuml SSD_03_Cooperative_Push
title SSD-03 무거운 오브젝트 협동 밀기
actor "플레이어 A" as PlayerA
actor "플레이어 B" as PlayerB
participant "Game System" as System

PlayerA -> System: pushObject(objectId, direction)
PlayerB -> System: pushObject(objectId, direction)
System -> System: validateRequiredPushers(objectId, direction)
alt 필요 인원과 방향 조건 충족
  System --> PlayerA: objectMoved(objectId, newPosition)
  System --> PlayerB: objectMoved(objectId, newPosition)
else 조건 미충족
  System --> PlayerA: pushPending(objectId)
  System --> PlayerB: pushPending(objectId)
end
@enduml

@startuml SSD_04_Stage_Settings_Menu
title SSD-04 ESC 설정 메뉴 열기/닫기
actor "플레이어" as Player
participant "Game System" as System

Player -> System: toggleStageSettingsMenu()
alt 메뉴 닫힘 상태
  System --> Player: showSettingsMenu()
  System --> Player: blockGameplayInput()
else 메뉴 열림 상태
  System --> Player: hideSettingsMenu()
  System --> Player: restoreGameplayInput()
end

opt 게임 나가기 선택
  Player -> System: leaveGame()
  System --> Player: moveToLobby()
end
@enduml
